# This repo is authored on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) but its deploy artifacts
# run on Raspberry Pi OS. Without these rules, a Windows checkout rewrites the
# shell scripts with CRLF, and a CRLF shell script fails on the Pi with the
# famously unhelpful "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M". That bites whenever the
# files reach the Pi by any route other than a fresh `git clone` on the Pi
# itself — scp, rsync, a mounted share, or a USB copy.
#
# Pin every Linux-side artifact to LF so it is correct however it gets there.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.service       text eol=lf
*.desktop       text eol=lf
deploy/**       text eol=lf

# Uploaded to the robot controller, which is Linux-side too.
*.lua           text eol=lf
